# Derive a Red Tektite room (overworld $76, west of the start) from the
# standard voxel state. Writes tests/voxel_tektite_test.nss.
TURBO ON
WAIT 2
LOAD_STATE tests/voxel_camera_test.nss
WAIT 10
HOLD LEFT
WAIT 150
RELEASE LEFT
WAIT 90
ASSERT_RAM8 00EB 76 room west of start
ASSERT_RAM8 0350 0E red tektite in slot 1
ASSERT_RAM8 00E0 00 not paused
SAVE_STATE tests/voxel_tektite_test.nss
EXIT 0
